Description: CUPS driver for the EPSON TM-T70II thermal receipt printer
 A raster CUPS driver (filter + libusb backend + PPD + udev rule) for the
 EPSON TM-T70II 80 mm thermal receipt printer.
 .
 The TM-T70II USB interface is a vendor-specific class that the kernel usblp
 driver does not bind, so this package ships its own "tmt70" backend that
 talks to the device directly with libusb.  The "rastertoescpos" filter turns
 the CUPS raster stream into ESC/POS graphics and exposes print density,
 print speed, 80/58 mm media width, 180 degree rotation, blank-space
 reduction, left margin, copies and cut behaviour as standard printer
 preferences.
